---
title: "assert_isolated_asset (Scallop Sui Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_isolated: is_isolated_asset(market, borrow_coin_type)
    q_check_isolated --> q_scan_debts_iso: asset IS isolated
    q_check_isolated --> q_scan_debts_non_iso: asset is NOT isolated
    q_scan_debts_iso --> q_iter_iso: for debt_type in obligation::debt_types
    q_iter_iso --> q_check_other_debt: debt_type != borrow_coin_type
    q_check_other_debt --> q_check_debt_amount: different type
    q_check_other_debt --> q_iter_iso: same type, skip
    q_check_debt_amount --> q_abort_iso: debt_amount > 0
    q_check_debt_amount --> q_iter_iso: debt_amount == 0
    q_iter_iso --> q_ok: all debts checked, no conflict
    q_abort_iso --> [*]: abort unable_to_borrow_other_coin_with_isolated_asset
    q_scan_debts_non_iso --> q_iter_non_iso: for debt_type in obligation::debt_types
    q_iter_non_iso --> q_check_iso_debt: is_isolated_asset(market, debt_type)
    q_check_iso_debt --> q_check_iso_amount: debt is isolated
    q_check_iso_debt --> q_iter_non_iso: debt not isolated, skip
    q_check_iso_amount --> q_abort_non_iso: debt_amount > 0
    q_check_iso_amount --> q_iter_non_iso: debt_amount == 0
    q_iter_non_iso --> q_ok: all debts checked, no conflict
    q_abort_non_iso --> [*]: abort unable_to_borrow_other_coin_with_isolated_asset
    q_ok --> [*]: isolated asset check passed

    note right of q_scan_debts_iso
        INV-001: isolated asset borrow requires no other active debts in obligation
    end note

    note right of q_scan_debts_non_iso
        INV-002: non-isolated borrow forbidden if obligation has any isolated debt
    end note
